    "    La trayectoria es $y(x) = \\frac{a}{2}\\left[\\left(\\frac{x}{a}\\right)^{1-k} - \\left(\\frac{x}{a}\\right)^{1+k}\\right] = 100\\left[\\left(\\frac{x}{200}\\right)^{0.8} - \\left(\\frac{x}{200}\\right)^{1.2}\\right]$.\n",
