    "Fnum(x, y) = x^4 / 4 - x^2 * y + y^2 / 2\n",
    "xs = ys = range(-2, 2, length = 300)\n",
    "Plots.contour(xs, ys, Fnum, levels = 20, xlab = L\"x\", ylab = L\"y\",\n",
    "        color = :viridis, cbar = true)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "690ce3b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "    Las curvas de nivel de $F$ (la \"energía\" del sistema) son las curvas integrales de la ecuación: la solución que pasa por cada punto es la curva de nivel que lo contiene.\n",
    "    :::\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#exr-factor-integrante}\n",
    "**Factor integrante.** La ecuación\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "y\\,dx + (2x - y e^{y})\\,dy = 0\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "no es exacta. Hallar un factor integrante de la forma $\\mu(y)$, resolver la ecuación y comprobar el resultado con `dsolve`.\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n",
    "## Ayuda\n",
    "Si $\\dfrac{\\partial N/\\partial x - \\partial M/\\partial y}{M}$ depende solo de $y$, entonces $\\mu(y) = e^{\\int \\frac{N_x - M_y}{M}\\,dy}$ es un factor integrante.\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{.callout-tip collapse=\"true\"}\n",
    "## Solución"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 30,
   "id": "ad7fbfe8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\frac{1}{y}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "1\n",
       "─\n",
       "y"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 30,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "@syms x y\n",
    "M = y\n",
    "N = 2x - y * exp(y)\n",
    "cociente = simplify((diff(N, x) - diff(M, y)) / M)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "519b4788",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "El cociente vale $1/y$, que depende solo de $y$, luego"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "809f09ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$y$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "y"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 31,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "μ = exp(integrate(cociente, y))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8fbb1bf2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "es decir, $\\mu(y)=y$. Multiplicando la ecuación por $\\mu$, queda $y^2\\,dx + (2xy - y^2 e^y)\\,dy = 0$, que ya es exacta:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 32,
   "id": "23cb4ab1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "true"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 32,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "M2, N2 = μ * M, μ * N\n",
    "diff(M2, y) == diff(N2, x)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 33,
   "id": "60a5de54",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$x y^{2} + \\left(- y^{2} + 2 y - 2\\right) e^{y}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "   2   ⎛   2          ⎞  y\n",
       "x⋅y  + ⎝- y  + 2⋅y - 2⎠⋅ℯ "
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 33,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "F = integrate(M2, x)\n",
    "F = F + integrate(N2 - diff(F, y), y) |> simplify"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "10e24ad0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "La solución general es $x y^2 - (y^2 - 2y + 2)e^y = C$. Comprobación con `dsolve` (tratando $x$ como función de $y$, pues la ecuación es lineal en $x$):"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 34,
   "id": "2e963ebe",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\frac{C_{1} + t^{2} e^{t} - 2 t e^{t} + 2 e^{t}}{t^{2}}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "      2  t        t      t\n",
       "C₁ + t ⋅ℯ  - 2⋅t⋅ℯ  + 2⋅ℯ \n",
       "──────────────────────────\n",
       "             2            \n",
       "            t             "
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 34,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "@syms t x()\n",
    "sol = dsolve(Eq(diff(x(t), t), (t * exp(t) - 2x(t)) / t), x(t))\n",
    "simplify(rhs(sol))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90df822d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Despejando se recupera la misma familia de curvas.\n",
    ":::\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#exr-lineal-circuito}\n",
    "**Ecuación lineal: circuito RC.** En un circuito RC en serie con resistencia $R = 1000\\ \\Omega$, condensador de capacidad $C=10^{-4}$ F y fuente de tensión alterna $E(t) = 12\\cos(10 t)$ V, la carga $q(t)$ del condensador satisface la ecuación lineal\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "R\\,q' + \\frac{q}{C} = E(t)\n",
    "\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n",
    "q' + 10\\,q = 0.012\\cos(10 t).\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "a.  Resolver la ecuación con $q(0)=0$ usando el método del factor integrante y separar la solución en régimen transitorio y régimen permanente.\n",
    "\n",
    "    :::{.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n",
    "    ## Ayuda\n",
    "    Para la ecuación lineal $q' + a q = b(t)$, el factor integrante es $\\mu(t)=e^{at}$ y la solución es $q(t)=e^{-at}\\left(\\int e^{at} b(t)\\,dt + C\\right)$. Resolver con `dsolve` y usar `expand` y `collect` para identificar los términos que decaen.\n",
    "    :::\n",
    "\n",
    "    :::{.callout-tip collapse=\"true\"}\n",
    "    ## Solución"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 35,
   "id": "7b9c1ea3",
   "metadata": {
    "md-indent": "    "
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2} \\sin{\\left(10 t + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{5000} - \\frac{3 e^{- 10 t}}{5000}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "        ⎛       π⎞           \n",
       "3⋅√2⋅sin⎜10⋅t + ─⎟      -10⋅t\n",
       "        ⎝       4⎠   3⋅ℯ     \n",
       "────────────────── - ────────\n",
       "       5000            5000  "
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 35,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "using SymPyPythonCall\n",
    "@syms t q()\n",
    "eq = Eq(diff(q(t), t) + 10 * q(t), Sym(12)/1000 * cos(10t))\n",
    "sol = dsolve(eq, q(t), ics = Dict(q(0) => 0))\n",
    "qsol = simplify(rhs(sol))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9490e64e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "    La solución es\n",
    "\n",
    "    $$\n",
    "    q(t) = \\underbrace{-\\,0.0006\\, e^{-10 t}}_{\\text{transitorio}} \\;+\\; \\underbrace{0.0006\\left(\\cos 10t + \\sin 10t\\right)}_{\\text{permanente}},\n",
    "    $$\n",
    "\n",
    "    donde el término exponencial (la solución de la homogénea) se extingue con constante de tiempo $\\tau = RC = 0.1$ s, y el término oscilante es la respuesta forzada por la fuente.\n",
    "    :::\n",
    "\n",
    "a.  Dibujar la solución junto con el régimen permanente y comprobar gráficamente que el transitorio desaparece en unas pocas constantes de tiempo.\n",
    "\n",
    "    :::{.callout-tip collapse=\"true\"}\n",
    "    ## Solución"
   ]
